只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A Git GUI plugin for DeepSeek Harness Web UI","id":"gh:1336042592","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-git-gui","slug":"lovetree128/dsh-git-gui","topics":["agentic-ai","ai","cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","git","git-gui","gui","javascript","plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A Git GUI plugin for DeepSeek Harness Web UI"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# `dsh-git-gui`"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English ·\n简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A **Git graphical interface plugin** for the DeepSeek Harness Web UI: view, stage, commit, and rever"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"t project changes directly in the browser, while seeing every modification the Agent (harness) makes"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" to workspace files in real time."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Current version: v0.1.2** — Visual operations for viewing changes, committing/reverting, remote "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"synchronization, and more are now available. Branch management, stash, and the AI modification timel"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ine are planned to be completed and released in v0.2.0. See the Roadmap below for details."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Changes View**: Changes are grouped into \"Staged / Modified / Untracked / Merge Conflicts\". Clic"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"k to view line-level diffs, stage/unstage changes with one click, and discard changes or delete untr"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"acked files with confirmation dialogs.\n- **File Tree View**: Browse all files in the workspace (auto"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"matically respecting `.gitignore`). File names are color-coded by status — unmodified files use the "},{"id":"p7s5","text":"default text color (black in light mode / white in dark mode), modified but uncommitted files are **"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"blue**, and untracked files are **red**. Supports directory collapsing and name filtering. Click an "},{"id":"p7s7","text":"unmodified file to preview its contents directly.\n- **Log View**: View commit history (hash / refere"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"nce badges / author / relative time), with support for reverting individual commits using `revert`.\n"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"- **Nested Repository Detection**: When the session workspace itself is not a Git repository, the pl"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"ugin automatically searches subdirectories for a single nested repository and uses it as the operati"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"on root (for example, when the repository is located in the `dsh-git-gui/` subdirectory of the works"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"pace). If multiple nested repositories are found, the plugin explicitly prompts the user instead of "},{"id":"p7s13","text":"guessing which one to use."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### GitHub Source"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### npm Source"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"After installation, restart `dsh web` and refresh the browser page."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Update"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Where to start"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"After installing the plugin, open the DeepSeek Harness Web UI and click the added button in the bott"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"om-left corner to open the sidebar. Then just enjoy the version control."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Structure"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Roadmap"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Stage | Content | Status |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| v0.1.1 | Changes / file tree / log + commit, stage, discard, revert, **Pull/Push/Fetch + Add Remot"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"e**, dark mode, nested repository detection | ✅ Current version |\n| v0.2.0 (unreleased) | **Branch m"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"anagement** (local/remote lists, switch/create, merge, ahead/behind) | 🔧 In progress |\n| v0.2.0 (unr"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"eleased) | **Stash** (push/pop/apply/drop) | 🔧 In progress |\n| v0.2.0 (unreleased) | **AI modificati"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"on timeline** (session × turn × tool → file attribution view) | 🔧 In progress |\n| Future ideas | Res"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"et entry point, file history (`git log -- <path>`), settings card (polling interval / Git path / ide"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"ntity fallback), interactive rebase (PTY) | 💡 To be designed |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Limitations"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- When panel operations and Agent edits occur concurrently, Git's own state is treated as authoritat"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ive. A warning bar is displayed while the session is running, and operations such as discarding chan"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ges require confirmation.\n- Untracked file content previews are limited to 512 KiB; diff output is l"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"imited to 4 MiB (truncation is marked); the file tree supports a maximum of 3,000 files.\n- Credentia"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"ls rely on existing Git credential helpers (WinCred / SSH agent). Interactive password input is disa"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"bled (`GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0`) to ensure operations do not hang.\n- On Windows, if the repository's `"},{"id":"p26s7","text":".git` directory was created by a process running with administrator privileges, tools running with n"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"ormal privileges, such as PyCharm, need to execute `git config --global --add safe.directory '<path>"},{"id":"p26s9","text":"'` (Git 2.35+ hijacking protection).\n- The plugin has not yet been tested on macOS or Linux. Please "},{"id":"p26s10","text":"report any issues you encounter."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
